        \App\Models\GrammarQuestion::create([
            'meeting_number' => 8,
            'section' => 'paragraph',
            'question_number' => 1,
            'question_text' => '<strong class=\"text-blue-600\">Di dalam kawasan hutan tropis</strong>, para peneliti bekerja setiap hari <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">untuk mempelajari perubahan di dalam ekosistem alami</strong>. <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">Dengan alat pengamatan lapangan</strong>, mereka mencatat data tentang hewan dan tumbuhan <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di sekitar aliran sungai</strong>. <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">Dalam kegiatan pemantauan lingkungan</strong>, tim biolog melakukan pengukuran suhu dan kelembapan <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di permukaan tanah</strong> dan <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di dalam area vegetasi rapat</strong>. <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">Untuk menjaga keseimbangan alam</strong>, program konservasi berlangsung secara rutin <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di sepanjang jalur perlindungan satwa liar</strong> dan <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di sekitar habitat penting</strong>. <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">Di dalam pusat edukasi lingkungan</strong>, para siswa belajar tentang peran manusia <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">di dalam pelestarian ekosistem</strong> dan <strong class=\"text-blue-600\">untuk masa depan bumi</strong>.',
            'correct_answer' => 'In the tropical forest area, researchers work every day to study changes in the natural ecosystem. With field observation tools, they record data about animals and plants around the river flow. In environmental monitoring activities, the biologist team measures temperature and humidity on the soil surface and in dense vegetation areas. To maintain natural balance, conservation programs take place routinely along wildlife protection paths and around important habitats. In the environmental education center, students learn about the human role in ecosystem preservation and for the future of the earth.',
            'meta_data' => []
        ]);
